{
  "description": "Buying through the buy menu's number keys doesn't leak the last digit into the game as a slot switch: holding a primary, b-5-2 (helmet), b-1-2 (a pistol replacing yours: primary in hand stays) and b-5-3 (shades: the kit is Artisan-only, so it's 3 for a Vibe Coder) all leave the primary in hand (operator report: buying shades switched weapons)",
